也想坚持啊，可每次准备做平板支撑的时候，手就很自然地伸去摸零食。\n[S2] 那不叫平板支撑，那叫“平板吃撑”。\n[S1] AI安慰我：“想健身的人，是把零食当奖励；不想健身的人，是把零食当训练。”\n[S2] ……所以计划、工具、AI，最后全变成了你“自我安慰体系”的一部分？\n[S1] 对，真正被我训练成功的，只有找借口的速度。\n[S2] 那你现在算是练成了——嘴皮子六块腹肌，身体还是原装配置。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "Text Multiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "links": [6, 7], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [270, 210], "pos": [1217.5101318359375, 496.679443359375], "widgets_values": ["32", 1.6, 2.5, true], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 5, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"name": "text", "link": 2, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "dialogue_audio_s2", "link": 8, "label": "dialogue_audio_s2", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "dialogue_audio_s2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "audio_npy_file", "label": "audio_npy_file", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "audio_npy_file"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "audio_s2_npy_file", "label": "audio_s2_npy_file", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "audio_s2_npy_file"}, {"widget": {"name": "time_step"}, "name": "time_step", "label": "time_step", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "time_step"}, {"widget": {"name": "p_w"}, "name": "p_w", "label": "p_w", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "p_w"}, {"widget": {"name": "t_w"}, "name": "t_w", "label": "t_w", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "t_w"}, {"widget": {"name": "unload_model"}, "name": "unload_model", "label": "unload_model", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "unload_model"}], "flags": {}, "id": 1, "type": "MegaTTS3Run", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MegaTTS3Run"}, "order": 4}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": t